# Review ownership.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file ASSIGNS reviewers. It does not REQUIRE review. Requiring review is a
# branch protection / ruleset setting that a repository administrator must configure by hand.
# See docs/operations/repository-administration.md. A CODEOWNERS file in a repository with no
# branch protection enforces nothing.
#
# Replace the placeholder teams with real GitHub teams before relying on this.

# Default
*                                   @<org>/agent-platform

# The strictest ownership in the repository: the tool API is identical across every domain,
# so a change here affects every agent team integrating with any domain.
/patterns/*/contracts/              @<org>/platform-architects
/standards/api-design.md            @<org>/platform-architects
/schemas/                           @<org>/platform-architects

# Security
/standards/security.md              @<org>/security-reviewers
**/controls-check.md                @<org>/security-reviewers
/.claude/rules/security-baseline.md @<org>/security-reviewers

# Platform-owned infrastructure is the only hard-enforcement seam.
/patterns/*/infrastructure/terraform/memory-bank-nfr/   @<org>/platform-architects @<org>/security-reviewers
/patterns/*/infrastructure/terraform/platform-owned/    @<org>/platform-architects @<org>/security-reviewers

# The SDLC itself
/CLAUDE.md                          @<org>/platform-leads
/.claude/                           @<org>/platform-leads
/standards/                         @<org>/platform-leads
/.github/workflows/                 @<org>/platform-leads

# Release machinery
/standards/release-management.md    @<org>/platform-leads
